# The Vercel project's Root Directory is video-sync-frontend, but the CLI
# uploads from the repo root - which is 1.4GB of dependencies and lab
# artifacts, and the upload aborts before it ever reaches the build.
#
# Everything listed here is irrelevant to a CRA build of the frontend. The
# frontend carries its own copy of the shared sync engine (scripts/sync-shared.mjs
# keeps them identical), so it does not read anything outside its own directory.

# Dependencies - reinstalled by the build, never uploaded
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Local build output; Vercel builds its own
**/build
**/dist
**/coverage

# Other services and tooling: not part of the frontend build
video-sync-backend
sync-harness
relay-go
formal
scripts

# Docs and captures
docs
assets

.git
